  <diagram id="3hBI0y8H70vgbFywNwVe" name="questioms-assumptions">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1001" dy="1796" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="_7i5zUcqKgoWcHXgZPlT-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1&gt;Part C — Questions &amp;amp; Assumptions&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DriveNow Car Rental Management System&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;List 1 — Questions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;7.1 — Branches and Staff&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can an employee change their role between Rental Agent, Mechanic, and other positions?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Does DriveNow need to retain the history of employee branch assignments and manager appointments?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can mechanics have more than one specialization, or must each mechanic have exactly one?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h3&gt;§7.2 — Training&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;What is the minimum passing score for a training course?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Does the minimum passing score vary by course?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Is there a maximum number of attempts allowed for a course?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can an employee enroll in the same course again while a previous attempt is still incomplete?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Should mandatory courses be automatically assigned to employees?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h3&gt;7.3 — Fleet, Categories, and Pricing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can an individual vehicle&#39;s special daily rate change over time?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Should historical vehicle-specific rates be retained in the same way as category rates?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can a vehicle-specific rate override the category rate for only a limited period?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Should the current physical location of a vehicle be stored directly or determined from its transfer history?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can a vehicle change its home branch permanently?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Should every vehicle status change record both the previous status and the new status?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can a vehicle status be changed without an employee being identified?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h3&gt;7.4 — Vehicle Equipment&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;24&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are extras tracked individually as physical items, or only by equipment type and quantity?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h3&gt;7.5 — GPS Tracking&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;26&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can a GPS device be removed and installed in another vehicle?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Does DriveNow need to retain the complete history of GPS installations?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h3&gt;7.6 — Vehicle Transfers&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Does transferring a vehicle change its registered home branch?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;How is the current physical branch of a vehicle determined?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Can a transfer be cancelled after it has been recorded?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Must the employee driving a transferred vehicle belong to the source branch?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Does the Fleet Manager&#39;s approval need to be recorded for every transfer?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;List 2 — Assumptions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;No composite&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 20px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;primary Key using surrogate key instead&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;§7.1 — Branches and Staff&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A unique &lt;code&gt;EmployeeID&lt;/code&gt; identifies each employee.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;A nullable &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;SupervisorID&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; is used to represent employees without a direct supervisor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;An &lt;code&gt;Is24Hours&lt;/code&gt; attribute is introduced to identify branches operating 24 hours a day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;For 24-hour branches, opening and closing times may be NULL, subject to the chosen implementation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Employee roles and their role-specific constraints will be represented using Classic Chen ERD without ISA specialization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h3&gt;7.2 — Training&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each training attempt is identified by a unique surrogate key called &lt;code&gt;AttemptID&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Repeated attempts by the same employee for the same course are stored as separate records.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;CompletionDate&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;Score&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;Result&lt;/code&gt; may be NULL until an attempt is completed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A course has an &lt;code&gt;IsMandatory&lt;/code&gt; attribute indicating whether it is mandatory or optional.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A completion date cannot be earlier than its enrollment date.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Scores must be between 0 and 100.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The number of attempts is calculated by querying training records rather than storing an additional attempt-count attribute.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h3&gt;7.3 — Fleet, Categories, and Pricing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each vehicle category is identified by a unique &lt;code&gt;CategoryID&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each vehicle model is identified by a unique &lt;code&gt;ModelID&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each category rate record has a unique &lt;code&gt;CategoryRateID&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Category prices are stored with &lt;code&gt;ValidFrom&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;ValidTo&lt;/code&gt; dates to preserve pricing history.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Effective pricing periods for the same category cannot overlap.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A vehicle&#39;s VIN is used as its primary key, while its plate number remains unique.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A vehicle&#39;s home branch is not automatically changed when the vehicle is transferred.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every vehicle status change is recorded in &lt;code&gt;VEHICLE_STATUS_HISTORY&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each status history record includes the previous status, new status, change timestamp, and responsible employee.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The current vehicle status is maintained in &lt;code&gt;VEHICLE&lt;/code&gt;, while previous changes remain in the history table.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Vehicle-specific rates are stored separately from category rates if the design adopts historical pricing for individual vehicles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h3&gt;7.4 — Vehicle Equipment&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;27&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Extras are identified by a unique &lt;code&gt;ExtraCode&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The quantity of an extra is stored as an attribute of the relationship between &lt;code&gt;RENTAL&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;EXTRA&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The daily charge applied at rental time is stored as &lt;code&gt;ChargedDailyRate&lt;/code&gt; on that relationship.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Quantity must be a positive integer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Extras&#39; current daily charges can change without modifying charges recorded on previous rentals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A separate extras price-history entity is not introduced unless Finance requires a complete pricing history.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h3&gt;7.5 — GPS Tracking&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;33&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each GPS device is identified by a unique &lt;code&gt;SerialNumber&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A GPS device can be installed in at most one vehicle at a time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt;InstallationDate&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(#000000, var(--ge-light-color, #ffffff));&quot;&gt; describes the installation relationship, not the GPS device itself.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Only the current installation is stored unless installation history is explicitly required.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;h3&gt;7.6 — Vehicle Transfers&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;39&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each vehicle transfer is identified by a unique &lt;code&gt;TransferID&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every transfer involves exactly one vehicle, one source branch, one destination branch, and one driver employee.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each transfer is recorded separately to preserve the complete movement history.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The source branch and destination branch of a transfer must be different.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The recorded source branch must match the vehicle&#39;s actual location before the transfer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;The odometer reading at transfer time cannot be negative.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="705" x="147" y="33" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="h0ssSWZzthQoTzZFIhSL" name=" 4-Business-Rules">
